    "raw_tagged": "And now followeth the history of the further adventures of {{person:ユーウェイン|Sir Ewaine}} as it is told in the books of chivalry that relate to these happenings, so I pray you to read that which followeth if that other which hath gone before hath been pleasing to you.",
