    "raw_tagged": "Thus {{person:ユーウェイン|Sir Ewaine}} was wedded at the castle of the {{special:魔法の泉|Fountain}}, and after that he dwelt in the land of the {{special:魔法の泉|Fountain}} with great peace and good content.",
    "zh_tw_tagged": "就這樣，{{person:ユーウェイン|尤溫爵士}}在{{special:魔法の泉|噴泉}}城堡完婚，此後便在{{special:魔法の泉|噴泉}}之境安享太平、心滿意足地生活下去。",
