    "raw_tagged": "\"So, though thou hast sinned, thou art still the creation of God and may yet do His will in the world who hath sent thee hither.\"",
    "zh_tw_tagged": "「是以，儘管你犯了罪，你依然是上帝的造物，仍可在這世上奉行那派遣你降世之主的聖意。」",
