    "translation_tagged": "そこで二人は数か月にわたって滞在し、その間は狩猟に鷹狩りに馬上槍試合にと明け暮れて、日々はこれ以上ありえぬほどの喜びと楽しみで満たされていた。",
    "raw_tagged": "There they abided for several months, in which time there was hunting and hawking and jousting, so that the days were as full of joy and pleasure as it was possible to be.",
